// ***********************************************************************
// * Last Updated:    	6 November 2011                                  *
// ***********************************************************************

// ENABLE: 0 - No, 1 - Yes           MANTRA: Words of Power
// CIRCLE: Spell Circle              ACTION: Animation
// MANA: Mana Cost                   DELAY:  Delay for casting (tenths of a second)
// LOSKILL: Minimum skill to cast    SCLO:   Min. Scroll Skill to cast
// HISKILL: 100% Success over this   SCHI:   100% Success over this
// TARG: message for targ. spells    RECOVERYDELAY: Delay until next spell can be cast (tenths of sec)
// FLAGS: 							 DAMAGEDELAY: Delay until damage portion of spell hits (tenths of sec)
// 0x1 or 1 - requireTarget
// 0x2 or 2 - reqItemTarget
// 0x4 or 4 - reqLocTarget
// 0x8 or 8 - reqCharTarget
// 0x10 or 16 - travelSpell
// 0x20 or 32 - fieldSpell
// 0x40 or 64 - spellReflectable
// 0x80 or 128 - aggressiveSpell
// 0x100 or 256 - resistable (unused)
// combined... requireCharTarget 8...spellreflectable 64...aggressive 128...resistable...256..456 or 0x01c8

